---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Results — TriCel CxnA | iDEC 2026"
  description="What we actually found: structural predictions for both CxnA domains, three rounds of mutant screening, a validated fluorescence assay, and an honest verdict — no confirmed improvement, but a working directed-evolution pipeline."
>

  <!-- ═══ PAGE HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Results</p>
      <h1>What we found — and what we didn't</h1>
      <p>
        CxnA is a two-domain enzyme: Cex (an exoglucanase) and CenA (an endoglucanase), fused
        together. We used error-prone PCR to scramble its DNA at random, then screened the
        resulting mutants to see whether any of them had picked up a useful new or improved
        activity. Computational predictions guided where we looked; the mutagenesis itself was
        random. No mutant clearly beat the unmodified enzyme — but the screening pipeline we
        built to find out is itself the result, and it's reusable for the next round.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ TOC — pill-bar (mobile/tablet) ═══ -->
  <div class="toc-pill-wrap">
    <nav class="toc-pill-bar" aria-label="Jump to result">
